OL,3,GNEWSACharity reflects on changing needs
OL,4,Aover 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that raises funds to provide
OL,7,Fchildren with "essential items" has
OL,8,Fsaid families are facing "changing
OL,9,Fpressures" as celebrates its 25th
OL,10,Fanniversary.
OL,12,FHelp a Guernsey Child said since it was
OL,13,Fcreated in 2001 it has provided more
OL,14,Fthan #1.2m worth of essential items,
OL,15,Fequipment, services and support to
OL,16,Flocal children and young people.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
