OL,3,GNEWSACharity reflects on changing needs
OL,4,Aover 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said in its early years it
OL,7,Fgave financial support to a number of
OL,8,Flarger community projects benefiting
OL,9,Fchildren but there was now an
OL,10,Fincreasing focus on helping individual
OL,11,Fchildren and families.
OL,13,FAlex Jenner, from Help a Guernsey
OL,14,FChild, said: "Over the past 25 years,
OL,15,Fwe have seen significant changes in the
OL,16,Ftypes of support families require."
